@startuml 04a_componentes_sistema
title NEUROPHOBIA - Diagrama de componentes (vista general)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
hide empty members

component "App VR NEUROPHOBIA" as App_VR_NEUROPHOBIA <<application>>
note bottom of App_VR_NEUROPHOBIA
  Unity 6000.3 · OpenXR · XR Toolkit
  APK Meta Quest 2/3/3S
  (repo NPdefdef)
end note
component "Web NEUROPHOBIA" as Web_NEUROPHOBIA <<application>>
note bottom of Web_NEUROPHOBIA
  React + TypeScript (Vite) · SPA
  (repo NP_Front)
end note
note "Almacenamiento local del visor\noutbox/ (RecordOutbox)\ndevice_context.json" as Almacenamiento_local_del_visor
component "API NEUROPHOBIA" as API_NEUROPHOBIA <<service>>
note bottom of API_NEUROPHOBIA
  FastAPI · Python 3.12 · Docker
  /api/v1 (contrato v1.1.0)
  (repo NP_Back)
end note
component "Proxy web" as Proxy_web <<component>>
note bottom of Proxy_web
  Vercel: api/proxy.mjs
  AWS: CloudFront /api/v1/*
  añade x-np-proxy-secret, x-np-client-ip
end note
component "Módulo de IA" as Módulo_de_IA <<component>>
note bottom of Módulo_de_IA
  app/ai · rules-baseline
  interfaz SessionAnalyzer
end note
database "PostgreSQL 17" as PostgreSQL_17 <<database>>

App_VR_NEUROPHOBIA ..> API_NEUROPHOBIA : IDeviceAPI /api/v1/device (HTTPS, token de dispositivo)
App_VR_NEUROPHOBIA ..> Almacenamiento_local_del_visor : «use» archivos
Web_NEUROPHOBIA ..> Proxy_web : IProxy /api/v1/* (mismo origen)
Proxy_web ..> API_NEUROPHOBIA : IWebAPI /api/v1 (JWT + cookie refresh)
API_NEUROPHOBIA ..> Módulo_de_IA : SessionAnalyzer
API_NEUROPHOBIA ..> PostgreSQL_17 : SQL (SQLAlchemy + Alembic)
@enduml
